Package: honets
Title: Higher-Order Network Analysis from Sequence Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mohammed", "Saqr", email = "saqr@saqr.me", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
    )
Description: Build and analyze higher-order networks from categorical
    sequence data. Implements higher-order networks (HON) with rule
    extraction Xu, Wickramarathne, and Chawla (2016)
    <doi:10.1126/sciadv.1600028>, higher-order network embedding (HONEM)
    Saebi et al. (2020) <doi:10.1089/big.2019.0169>, hypergeometric path
    anomaly detection (HYPA) LaRock et al. (2020)
    <doi:10.1137/1.9781611976236.52>, and the multi-order generative
    model (MOGen) Scholtes (2017) <doi:10.1145/3097983.3098145>. Includes
    a permutation-based Markov order test and a per-context path-dependence
    diagnostic based on conditional Kullback-Leibler divergence.
